    "Any device on your network (or nearby, with Direct Wireless Connection on) and any app on this Mac can see and control it without pairing. Connections are still encrypted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Any device on your network (or nearby, with Direct Wireless Connection on) and any app on this Mac can see and control it without pairing. Connections are still encrypted."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此网络上的任何设备（开启无线直连时也包括附近的设备）以及这台 Mac 上的任何应用，无需配对即可查看和控制它。连接仍会加密。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此網路上的任何裝置（開啟無線直接連線時也包括附近的裝置）以及這部 Mac 上的任何 App，無需配對即可查看及控制它。連線仍會加密。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Anyone on the internet can now reach port %@ and try to connect. Sill turns away every device you haven’t paired. Turning this off doesn’t close the port on your router: remove the forward there too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "現在網際網路上的任何人都能連到連接埠 %@ 並嘗試連線。Sill 會拒絕所有未配對的裝置。關閉此選項不會關閉路由器上的連接埠，請一併到路由器移除轉送設定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Approve Sill in System Settings › Login Items": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Approve Sill in System Settings › Login Items"
          }
