            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each device asks for its own screen’s rate, up to this limit. Quality is per 60 fps; a 120 fps stream gets twice as much. %@ Changes apply at once: the current stream restarts for a moment.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每部裝置會依自己螢幕的更新率要求影格率，最高到此上限。畫質以 60 fps 計算；120 fps 串流使用雙倍位元率。%@更改會立即套用：目前的串流會短暫重新開始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each iPhone or iPad pairs once: over the USB cable by itself, or on Wi‑Fi with a code this Mac shows when the device asks. Everything devices send and receive is encrypted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each iPhone or iPad pairs once: over the USB cable by itself, or on Wi‑Fi with a code this Mac shows when the device asks. Everything devices send and receive is encrypted."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每台 iPhone 或 iPad 只需配对一次：连接 USB 线缆即可自动配对，或在 Wi‑Fi 下输入设备请求时这台 Mac 显示的配对码。设备收发的所有数据都会加密。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
