    "If your iPhone or iPad can’t find this Mac, allow Sill in Privacy & Security › Local Network.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If your iPhone or iPad can’t find this Mac, allow Sill in Privacy & Security › Local Network."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果 iPhone 或 iPad 找不到这台 Mac，请在“隐私与安全性”›“本地网络”中允许 Sill。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果 iPhone 或 iPad 找不到這部 Mac，請在「隱私權與安全性」›「區域網路」中允許 Sill。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If your router has a dynamic DNS name, enter it so your devices keep finding this Mac when your internet address changes. Add :port if the router forwards a different outside port.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果路由器有動態 DNS 名稱，請在此輸入，網際網路位址變更時裝置仍能找到這部 Mac。如果路由器轉送的是另一個外部連接埠，請在後面加上「:連接埠」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Sill on your iPhone or iPad, tap this Mac, or tap Add a Mac… when you’re away, then point it at this code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Sill on your iPhone or iPad, tap this Mac, or tap Add a Mac… when you’re away, then point it at this code."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 iPhone 或 iPad 上打开 Sill，轻点这台 Mac；在外时，轻点“添加 Mac…”，然后将摄像头对准此二维码。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 iPhone 或 iPad 上打開 Sill，點一下這部 Mac；在外時點一下「加入 Mac⋯」，再將相機對準此 QR 碼。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Internet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "網際網路"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It paired by itself over the USB cable, and can connect over Wi‑Fi and nearby from now on too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It paired by itself over the USB cable, and can connect over Wi‑Fi and nearby from now on too."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备已通过 USB 线缆自动配对，今后也可通过 Wi‑Fi 或附近的直连方式连接。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "裝置已透過 USB 連接線自動配對，今後也可透過 Wi‑Fi 或附近的直接連線方式連線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It tried to connect with an older Sill.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It tried to connect with an older Sill."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
