    "On · no VPN on this Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On · no VPN on this Mac"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已开启 · 这台 Mac 未连接 VPN"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已開啟 · 這部 Mac 未連接 VPN"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once a day, Sill asks GitHub whether a newer version is out. GitHub sees this Mac’s IP address and which version of Sill it has; nothing else is sent. Sill never downloads or installs anything by itself: a new version opens its page on GitHub, where you download it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 每天會向 GitHub 查詢一次是否有新版本。GitHub 會看到這部 Mac 的 IP 位址和 Sill 的版本，不會傳送其他資料。Sill 不會自行下載或安裝任何東西：有新版本時會打開 GitHub 上的頁面，由你自己下載。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only needed for a port forward on your router. A VPN is simpler and keeps this Mac off the open internet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有在路由器上設定連接埠轉送時才需要。用 VPN 比較簡單，也能讓這部 Mac 不暴露在公開的網際網路上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
