    "Sill Log": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 記錄"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill appears on your iPhone and iPad once this Mac is on Wi-Fi or Ethernet and Local Network access is allowed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill appears on your iPhone and iPad once this Mac is on Wi-Fi or Ethernet and Local Network access is allowed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 接入 Wi-Fi 或以太网并获准访问本地网络后，就会显示在 iPhone 和 iPad 上。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這部 Mac 連上 Wi-Fi 或乙太網路並獲准存取區域網路後，就會顯示在 iPhone 和 iPad 上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill couldn’t use its key in your keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill couldn’t use its key in your keychain."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 未能使用钥匙串中的密钥。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 無法使用鑰匙圈中的金鑰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill couldn’t use its key in your keychain. Quit Sill and open it again, and choose Always Allow if the keychain asks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill couldn’t use its key in your keychain. Quit Sill and open it again, and choose Always Allow if the keychain asks."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 未能使用钥匙串中的密钥。请退出并重新打开 Sill；若钥匙串弹出询问，请选择“始终允许”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 無法使用鑰匙圈中的金鑰。請結束並重新打開 Sill；若鑰匙圈詢問，請選擇「永遠允許」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill doesn’t check for updates in test pattern mode.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 在測試圖樣模式下不會檢查更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill is up to date.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 已是最新版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill moves the window you pick onto an invisible display made for your device, so it keeps updating when other windows cover it and text is drawn at your device’s scale. The window leaves this screen while it streams and comes back when you stop streaming or quit Sill.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 會把你選的視窗移到為裝置建立的隱形顯示器上，即使被其他視窗擋住也會持續更新，文字也會以裝置的比例繪製。串流期間視窗會離開這個螢幕，停止串流或結束 Sill 時再回到原位。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill streams at these while every connected device is away from home, through a VPN or over the internet, so a slow connection never starts at your home quality. A device away from home changes these, and never your Quality and Resolution above.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有已連線的裝置都在外（透過 VPN 或網際網路連線）時，Sill 會用這裡的設定串流，讓較慢的連線不會一開始就用在家時的畫質。在外的裝置只會更改這裡的設定，不會動到上方的「畫質」和「解析度」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill streams at these while every connected device is away from home, through a VPN or over the internet, so a slow connection never starts at your home quality. A device away from home changes these, and never your Quality and Resolution above. Streaming at these now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有已連線的裝置都在外（透過 VPN 或網際網路連線）時，Sill 會用這裡的設定串流，讓較慢的連線不會一開始就用在家時的畫質。在外的裝置只會更改這裡的設定，不會動到上方的「畫質」和「解析度」。目前正以這些設定串流。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
